{"t":"FIS","made":"2026-11-18 01:51","name":"Fidelity National Information Services, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","employees":44000,"hq":"Jacksonville, FL, United States","website":"https://www.fisglobal.com","summary_en":"Fidelity National Information Services, Inc. provides solutions to financial institutions, businesses, and developers worldwide. The company operates through Banking Solutions, Capital Market Solutions, and Corporate and Other segments. It provides core processing and ancillary applications; mobile and online banking; fraud, risk management, and compliance; card and retail payment; electronic funds transfer and network; wealth and retirement; and item processing and output solutions. The company also offers trading and assets, lending, leveraged and syndicated loan markets, and treasury and risk solutions. Fidelity National Information Services, Inc. was founded in 1968 and is headquartered in Jacksonville, Florida.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Fidelity National Information Services, Inc.는 전 세계 금융 기관, 기업 및 개발자에게 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 뱅킹 솔루션, 자본 시장 솔루션, 기업 및 기타 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 핵심 처리 및 보조 애플리케이션을 제공합니다. 모바일 및 온라인 뱅킹; 사기, 위험 관리 및 규정 준수; 카드 및 소매 결제; 전자 자금 이체 및 네트워크; 부와 은퇴; 품목 처리 및 출력 솔루션. 이 회사는 또한 거래 및 자산, 대출, 레버리지 및 신디케이트 대출 시장, 재무 및 위험 솔루션을 제공합니다. Fidelity National Information Services, Inc.는 1968년에 설립되었으며 플로리다주 잭슨빌에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":27.6799,"mcap":14268164096.0,"pe":4.1375036,"fpe":5.0527916,"peg":0.2198,"ps":1.1028106,"pb":0.880124,"ev_ebitda":9.37,"div":6.22,"beta":0.853,"hi52":68.37,"lo52":27.362},"fin":{"rev":12938000384.0,"rev_g":0.271,"eps_g":0.38,"gross":0.35731998,"op":0.21464,"net":0.26774,"roe":0.23042,"fcf":2316499968.0,"cash":740000000.0,"debt":20846000128.0,"de":128.433,"eps":6.69,"feps":5.47814},"own":{"short":0.047199998,"inst":0.99541,"insider":0.00135},"analyst":{"n":23,"mean":35.17391,"median":33.0,"high":61.0,"low":25.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.63333,"trend":[{"i